                "text": "I was proud to cosponsor a bill that would protect the right to seek IVF treatment. That's as pro-family as it gets \u2014 but yesterday Republicans refused to even put it on the floor.\n\nEvery American who wants to be a parent should have that opportunity. https://t.co/OZAjQAPnu5",
